Return JSON matching the MARGO Directive schema:
{
  "goal": "...",
  "structured_constraints": { ... },
  "natural_language": "...",
  "policy_hint": "daily" | "trend_push" | "cohort_expansion" | null
}

The ``policy_hint`` drives the User Agent's dual-layer Rejected handling:
- ``"daily"`` → safe daily recommendation; strict avoidance of user rejections
- ``"trend_push"`` → exploratory new-season push; soft avoidance
- ``"cohort_expansion"`` → cohort-driven taste expansion; light avoidance
- ``null`` (omit) → legacy behaviour, Rejected layer not applied
Pick the one that best matches the brief's tone. Default to ``"daily"`` if uncertain.
